136
00:15:45,190 --> 00:15:49,550
Today we're going to talk about how to protect our eyes.

137
00:15:50,450 --> 00:15:53,550
Nowadays, many of us get eye problems.

138
00:15:55,010 --> 00:15:58,530
That's because we don't use our eyes in correct ways.

139
00:15:59,550 --> 00:16:01,390
Here's some advice.

140
00:16:02,310 --> 00:16:08,670
We can't watch the screen of a TV, a computer or a smartphone for a long time.

141
00:16:10,150 --> 00:16:14,930
Every 20 minutes, we should stop to look at something far away.

142
00:16:15,810 --> 00:16:20,270
And we are supposed to wear sunglasses when out in the sun.

143
00:16:21,270 --> 00:16:24,030
We'd better not read in the sun.

144
00:16:24,030 --> 00:16:28,370
It's harmful to our eyes.

145
00:16:28,910 --> 00:16:36,330
According to reports, about 35.6 of primary school students and nearly 81

146
00:16:37,030 --> 00:16:40,110
of senior high school students are nearsighted.

147
00:16:41,350 --> 00:16:46,950
So after class, students should be encouraged to go outside during breaks.

148
00:16:47,950 --> 00:16:53,510
Another important thing is to get an eye examination every two years.

149
00:16:54,790 --> 00:17:01,070
If the doctors notice our problems earlier, it'll be easier to correct the problems.

150
00:17:02,570 --> 00:17:06,510
That's all. Thanks for listening.

